1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,240
我要去一趟洗手间 很快回来
Hey, I'm gonna go to the bathroom real quick.

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:04,280
我想去照照镜子
I want to look in the mirror

3
00:00:04,280 --> 00:00:05,720
确认下我的眼神依旧死气沉沉
and make sure I'm still dead in the eyes.

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:09,300
你觉得你能应付好我这区吗
You think you can handle my section?

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,140
当然 我觉得我完全应付得过来
Uh, yeah, I think I can handle it.

6
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,820
厄尔 不知道你有没有注意到
Hey, Earl, I don't know if you noticed,

7
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:16,500
但现在整间餐厅都归我管耶
but I'm running the whole diner right now.

8
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:17,640
厉害吧
What, what?

9
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,980
十号桌的客人好像噎着了
The customer at table ten appears to be choking,

10
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:22,960
我想去帮忙
And I would help,

11
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,080
但我上次对一个白人女性实施海姆利克法
but the last time I gave a white woman the heimlich,

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,400
被抓进伯明翰的监狱关了六个月呢
I did six months in the Birmingham city jail.

13
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:29,980
天啊 您是噎着了吗
Oh, my God, are you choking?

14
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:32,360
天啊 我感觉您像是噎着了
Oh, my god, I feel like you're choking!

15
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,740
这里有人是医生吗
Is anyone here a doctor?

16
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,820
我在胡说什么 这里哪会有医生来
What am I saying? I forgot where I am.

17
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,740
这里有人看过《实习医生风云》吗
Has anyone here ever seen Scrubs?

18
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,800
当有姑娘噎着时该怎么做啊
What do you do when a girl is choking?

19
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:44,420
我会从她嘴里"拔出来"一点
I just back up a few inches.

20
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:47,900
我们该怎么办
What do we do?

21
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,860
怎么办啊 这个女人被噎着了
What do we do? This woman is choking!

22
00:00:57,280 --> 00:00:58,840
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

23
00:00:58,840 --> 00:00:59,800
不用客气
You're welcome.

24
00:01:00,160 --> 00:01:02,300
你觉得自己的命值多少 就给多少小费吧
And feel free to tip me what you think your life's worth.

25
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,740
感觉要有三块钱入袋啦
I feel 3 bucks coming my way.

26
00:01:23,800 --> 00:01:26,000
上菜啦 各位 这家店就我一个服务员
Here you go, guys. I'm the only waitress.

27
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,340
您等这汉堡的时间
Sorry you waited longer for the burger

28
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,500
比科斯比毛衣再流行还久 真对不住
than you did for that Cosby sweater to come back.

29
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:35,760
麦克斯 看我的表情 我非常不爽
Max, look at my face. I'm very upset.

30
00:01:38,020 --> 00:01:40,820
原来是不爽啊 我还以为你是一脸便秘相呢
Is that what that means? I just assumed you were constipated.

31
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,440
卡洛琳又迟到了
Caroline is late again.

32
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:47,660
她最好别再拿你们新蛋糕店当借口
And she better not use your new cupcake shop as an excuse this time,

33
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,860
因为妹子 老娘才不信那屁话呢
'cause sister, that crap ain't gonna fly.

34
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,320
首先
First of all,

35
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,460
请不要学黑人疯婆子电影里的语气说话
stop talking like you're in a Tyler Perry movie.

36
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:55,180
其次
And secondly,

37
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:58,160
卡洛琳在呢 她在厨房啊
Caroline's here; she's in the kitchen.

38
00:01:58,940 --> 00:02:00,680
是吗 刚才我在厨房
Oh, really? 'cause when I was in there,

39
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,041
你跟我说她在外面
you told me she was out here.

40
00:02:02,041 --> 00:02:04,137
你耍老娘啊
You play me, fool.

41
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,980
请别学黑人疯婆子电影续集里的语气说话
Stop talking like you're in a Tyler Perry Sequel.

42
00:02:07,220 --> 00:02:08,640
-其次... -我问厄尔好了
- And secondly-- - I'll ask Earl.

43
00:02:09,229 --> 00:02:10,302
厄尔
Earl...

44
00:02:10,580 --> 00:02:11,060
哎哟喂
Ow!

45
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:15,300
怎么了 你干嘛尖叫
What happened? Why did you scream?

46
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:18,060
我刚不小心坐到我的"蛋"了
I accidentally sat on one of my boys!

47
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,580
你今晚有见过卡洛琳吗
Have you seen Caroline tonight?

48
00:02:21,700 --> 00:02:22,840
当然有啦 兄弟
Of course I have, man.

49
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:25,100
我刚看见她走到那头去洗手间了
I just saw her go down the hall to the ladies room.

50
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:26,340
瞧 开心了吧
There. Happy?

51
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,040
你破解了大谜题 小洛克·福尔小厮
You've solved the big mystery, Shortlock Holmes.

52
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,680
慢着 她没有端任何她的...
Wait, she didn't pick up any of her--

53
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:35,720
卡洛琳
Caroline?

54
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,020
没功夫搭理你 阿憨
Can't talk now, Han.

55
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,920
我得跟你说多少遍 你才愿意
And how many more times do I have to ask you

56
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,280
修好这个放派的转盘啊
to fix this damn pie carousel?

57
00:02:41,400 --> 00:02:43,220
温度一点都不够凉
I mean, the temp just isn't cool enough,

58
00:02:43,220 --> 00:02:44,880
西米露很容易会变质
and those tapiocas are gonna turn bad.

59
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:47,120
如果你想吃官司 就继续忽视我的话吧
If you do want a lawsuit, just keep ignoring me.

60
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,480
麦克斯 能进我几分钟前
Max, can I see you in the kitchen

61
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,740
就待过的厨房说说话吗
where I was just a couple minutes ago

62
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:50,720
虽然我后来去上了个厕所
after I got out of the ladies room?

63
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,720
对啊 赶紧弄那玩意的温度
Yeah, get on that temperature thing.

64
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:56,280
里面霉菌那个多呀
There's so much mold growing in there

65
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:58,040
樱桃派都得来个子宫颈抹片检查了
that cherry pie's gonna need a pap smear.

66
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,540
刚才还真是有种够胆
That was some ballsy, bold,

67
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,960
牛逼哄哄的扯谎呀
in-your-face awesome lying.

68
00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:07,360
虎父无犬子嘛 父亲大人
I learned it by watching you, dad.

69
00:03:08,880 --> 00:03:10,900
不撒谎不行 为了蛋糕店
Had to lie. We need every minute

70
00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:13,400
我们得尽可能偷时间 能偷多少是多少
we can steal away from here to get the cupcake shop ready.

71
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:15,400
我们还得再刷一遍漆
We still have to do the second coat of paint,

72
00:03:15,460 --> 00:03:16,780
搞定桌椅...
figure out tables and chairs...

73
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,120
看什么 我没时间吃午饭
What? Didn't have time for lunch.

74
00:03:20,080 --> 00:03:21,060
我又不在乎
Oh, I don't care.

75
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:22,340
我只是惊讶你居然还用勺子
I'm surprised you're using a spoon.

76
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:23,580
我通常直接把脸埋进去吃
I just stick my face in it.

77
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:29,020
我有个能把这一切搞定的绝妙主意
So, my brilliant idea of how we get this all done

78
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,740
就是招个实习生来帮忙
is we should get an intern to help.

79
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:32,700
什么 不行
What? No.

80
00:03:33,060 --> 00:03:34,800
我当不了用实习生的老板
I can't be a person that has an intern.

81
00:03:34,860 --> 00:03:37,120
我连当个没实习生跟班的老板都很勉强了
I can barely be a person that doesn't have an intern.

82
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,740
麦克斯 所有企业都用实习生啊
Max, all businesses use interns.

83
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,240
只需在纽约大学或哥伦比亚大学的网上
We just have to post an ad online

84
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,480
发个招聘广告
at NYU or Columbia,

85
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:45,640
就能收到雪片般飞来
And we'll have 20 applicants battling it out

86
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,740
争先恐后求这苦差事的申请
to do our grunt work for credit.

87
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,540
被你说得像是《饥饿游戏之大学版》
You make it sound like The Hunger Games: college edition.

88
00:03:52,580 --> 00:03:54,680
抱歉 我反对不给钱让人干白活
Sorry, I'm against getting people to work for free.

89
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,776
我同意 麦克斯
I'm with you, Max.

90
00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:59,160
我们黑人免费"实习"了436年呢[黑奴]
My people were interns for 436 years.

91
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:05,180
我才刚习惯拥有自己的小生意这个念头
I am just getting used to the idea of having my own business

92
00:04:05,180 --> 00:04:06,920
现在你就要我当别人的老板啊
and now you want me to be someone's boss?

93
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,080
我不是当老板的料
I am not the boss.

94
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:10,480
我是那种在老板背后说他坏话的人
I'm the person who talks behind the boss's back.

95
00:04:11,322 --> 00:04:12,720
上菜
Pick up.

96
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,440
谢了 阿憨是个傻逼吧
Thanks. Isn't han a tool?

97
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:17,380
-纯傻逼 -一个小傻逼[工具]
- Total tool. - Yeah, a tiny tool.

98
00:04:18,380 --> 00:04:20,540
就像拿来修眼镜的小工具一样
Like the kind you fix your eyeglasses with.

99
00:04:24,440 --> 00:04:24,840
看见了吗
See?

100
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,140
那才是我擅长的事
That's my wheelhouse.

101
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:28,760
我不想让人来免费帮咱们工作
Look, I don't want to ask someone to work for free.

102
00:04:28,780 --> 00:04:29,940
我们可以自己做啊
We can do it all ourselves.

103
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:32,000
你想一切都自己搞定吗 没问题
You want to do it all yourself? Great.

104
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,080
我会列个待办清单 你得去办好一切
I'll write everything you need to do on a to-do list.

105
00:04:34,420 --> 00:04:36,000
为什么你不"去办"呢
Why don't you to-do that?

106
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,960
然后我"去把它撕成碎片"
And I will to-tear it up.

107
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:39,800
我们要把什么撕碎
What're we tearing up?

108
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:41,820
如果是卡洛琳的翘臀 那我已经搞定了
'cause if it's that ass, I already got that covered.

109
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:44,640
安迪 那番话真是又甜蜜又下流
Hi, Andy. That's so sweet and dirty.

110
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:47,780
要这么激情吗 你又不是要被送去打仗
Easy, easy. What are you, shipping off to war?

111
00:04:49,760 --> 00:04:51,420
来 这大包彩虹糖给你
Here. Take this giant bag of skittles

112
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,840
-别插手这事 -老娘可没这么好哄
- and look the other way. - I'm not that easy.

113
00:04:54,380 --> 00:04:55,840
哇 新的神秘口味
Ooh, new mystery flavors?

114
00:04:57,540 --> 00:04:59,040
下班后再见对吧
We getting together after you get off work?

115
00:04:59,180 --> 00:05:00,380
今天会非常晚
It'll be really late.

116
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:02,120
我和麦克斯还得去小蛋糕店
Max and I still have to go to the cupcake shop

117
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:04,200
用胶带把窗户粘上 这样明天好开工装修
and tape up the windows so we can start the trim tomorrow.

118
00:05:04,540 --> 00:05:05,800
好吧 虽然我不擅长刷漆
Okay, I'm not very good at painting,

119
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,940
但你刷漆时 我可以在一边做这个
but I can do this while you paint.

120
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,000
对
Yeah.

121
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,680
就这样 把油漆刷到墙上
Yeah, roll that paint on that wall.

122
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:18,980
你真是可爱到爆
You are so freaking cute.

123
00:05:19,782 --> 00:05:22,521
白人果然都是白痴
Ugh, white people.

124
00:05:24,940 --> 00:05:26,460
你们何不找个实习生呢
Look, why don't you guys just get an intern?

125
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,820
我当初开店的时候也是这么做
That's what I did when I opened my shop.

126
00:05:28,260 --> 00:05:30,300
你们俩简直就是魔鬼军阀
You two are like evil warlords

127
00:05:30,820 --> 00:05:32,380
开采着无辜丧尸的灵魂
mining the souls of innocent zombies.

128
00:05:33,540 --> 00:05:35,280
对了 要注意看看你的店
Oh, and keep your eyes peeled at your store.

129
00:05:35,340 --> 00:05:37,040
门卫说他发现里面有老鼠屎
The janitor told me he saw some rat droppings.

130
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,840
不过你们只需弄几个扑鼠器就行了
But all you gotta do is set up some traps.

131
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:42,060
真恶心 谁来干这活啊
Oh, gross. Who's gonna do that?

132
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,000
实习生吗
The intern?

133
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:51,380
露丝 纽约大学大二生 主修金融是吗
So, Ruth, you are a sophomore at NYU, majoring in finance?

134
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:52,880
你知道是无偿干白活吧
You know you're not gonna get paid.

135
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,140
一分钱都没有哦
No money at all.

136
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:55,740
对啊 实习就是这样啊
Yup, it's in internship.

137
00:05:55,740 --> 00:05:57,620
我是说 没关系的 对吧
I mean, it's all good, right?

138
00:05:59,040 --> 00:06:01,240
直到你需要钱就有关系了
It's all good until you need money.

139
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:04,500
我们是家刚起步的公司
Well, we're a startup company,

140
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:06,620
刚开设我们头一家零售店
and we're launching our very first retail store,

141
00:06:06,620 --> 00:06:09,300
所以你需要负责很多小事
so there's a lot of details that you'll be responsible for.

142
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,880
很多搬运工的事
There's a lot of carrying things,

143
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:12,780
可能还有些捕猎的事情哦
maybe some trapping things.

144
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,520
没关系 我有车
Oh, it's cool. I have a car.

145
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,800
你是有车一族 居然还想当实习生
You have a car and you want to be an intern?

146
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,060
不然咱俩换一换
How 'bout if we switch places?

147
00:06:20,180 --> 00:06:21,340
我来当有车的实习生
I'll be the intern with the car,

148
00:06:21,340 --> 00:06:23,060
你来坐这张烂的折叠椅
and you can sit on a broken folding chair

149
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:24,360
坐在女版唐纳德·川普[大亨]的旁边
next to Donna Trump over here.

150
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:27,340
我和麦克斯现在得开个小会
Well, Max and I need to have a little meeting right now,

151
00:06:27,340 --> 00:06:29,440
你最好去那边的等候区稍等一会
so if you could go over to the waiting room, that'd be great.

152
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,080
可以吗 露丝[同情心]
Okay, Ruth?

153
00:06:30,340 --> 00:06:32,620
我想说我知道我的名字很奇怪
I just wanna say I know my name is weird,

154
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:34,740
但现在改名太晚了 对吧
but like it's too late, right?

155
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,040
麦克斯 你干嘛试图说服她
Max, why are you trying to convince her

156
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,200
不要当我们的实习生啊
to not be our intern?

157
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,920
你又干嘛不告诉她
Why are you not saying,

158
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:45,020
"你可能因老鼠而染上狂犬病和黑死病啊"
"You may get rabies and bubonic plague from our rats?"

159
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,920
别提老鼠
Don't mention the rats.

160
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,340
你会吓跑人家
You're chasing them away.

161
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:52,940
而且我们这里只有老鼠屎 没有老鼠
And we do not have rats. We have rat droppings.

162
00:06:53,100 --> 00:06:54,360
别过早下结论
Let's not jump to conclusions.

163
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,100
你说得对 老鼠可能只是
You're right, the rats are probably

164
00:06:56,100 --> 00:06:57,700
来这里借个厕所而已
just coming in here to use the bathroom.

165
00:06:59,620 --> 00:07:01,160
我们需要一名实习生
Look, we need an intern.

166
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,500
目前为止 你最喜欢哪一个
Now, who do you like so far?

167
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:04,660
大咪咪的那个
The one with the big boobs.

168
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:07,620
我就知道 你们大咪咪星人都相互帮助
I knew it. All you big boob people stick together.

