算了 我来给她发短信吧
Never mind. I'll just text her.

385
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:02,040
小心点
Well, be careful.

386
00:17:02,160 --> 00:17:04,200
别误删我珍藏的鸡鸡戴帽图
Don't delete any of my penis with a hat pictures.

387
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:06,440
就算误删了 也没什么损失啊
Even if I did, it's not a big deal.

388
