所以她今天来不了
And she can't come in today?

398
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:33,040
我受够了 炒了她
That's it. She's fired.

399
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:34,520
给 你来负责炒她
Here. You have to fire her.

400
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:37,680
她都说她病了 你个康德那屎
She said she was sick, Conde nasty.

401
