她才没病呢 只是看你好说话
She's not sick, she's just taking advantage

402
00:17:41,140 --> 00:17:42,320
占你便宜 偷懒呢
'cause you're too friendly with her.

403
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:43,760
她是给我们打工的
She works for us.

404
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:45,680
对啊 免费干白活呢
Yeah, for free.

405
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,380
你怎么不干脆挖空人家
Why don't you just hollow her out

406
