你单手把那大铁闸给举起了
You just lifted that giant thing up with one hand.

452
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:45,760
我知道
I know.

453
00:19:45,760 --> 00:19:48,420
现在老娘要炒了那小贱人
And now I'm gonna fire that bitch!

454
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:56,440
哇 你贴东西也好烂
Wow. You suck at this too.

455
