除了是一个老板
In addition to being a boss,

466
00:20:23,862 --> 00:20:25,380
我也是个女服务员
I am also a waitress.

467
00:20:25,380 --> 00:20:27,900
但当我在工作时 我从不叫人白痴
But when I do my job, I don't call people dumb.

468
