你在说那件事啊
Oh, you're talking about that thing?

470
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:33,660
我叫的是卡洛琳啦
I meant Caroline.

471
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:35,460
不 我知道你是说我
No, I know you meant me,

472
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,740
因为我不是白痴 卡洛琳也不白痴
Because I'm not dumb and neither is Caroline.

473
00:20:38,180 --> 00:20:40,280
而做生意我学到的一件事就是
And one thing I figured out is that in business,

474
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:42,040
有时候我得更铁石心肠[无露丝]
maybe I have to be a little more Ruthless.

475
